<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MARCH 24.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MARCH 24.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Estonian Kuku radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Prime minister Mart Siimann approved Daniel Vaarik as the new government press spokesperson </p>
<p>- The security police have arrested a man accused of illegally importing 1000 pistols.</p>
<p>- Tuberculosis is on the increase in Estonia.</p>
<p>- Prime minister Siimann is interested in good relations with Russia.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
